msgstr "Pemasang Paket Debian"

#: src/ui/mod.rs:141
msgid "Debby contributors"
msgstr "Kontributor Debby"

#: src/ui/mod.rs:143
msgid ""
"Debby makes installing local Debian packages simple. Open a .deb file to "
"view package details, compare installed and selected versions, and install, "
"upgrade, reinstall, or uninstall the package. Follow each operation on a "
"dedicated progress screen and view dependencies and command output in the "
"Details panel."
msgstr "Debby memudahkan pemasangan paket Debian lokal. Buka berkas .deb untuk melihat rincian paket, membandingkan versi terpasang dan versi yang dipilih, serta memasang, meningkatkan, memasang ulang, atau mencopot paket. Pantau setiap operasi pada layar kemajuan khusus dan lihat dependensi serta keluaran perintah di panel Rincian."

